+- `add with past dueDate is overdue` → `add({title:'A', dueDate:'2026-11-12'}).overdue === true`.
+- `dueDate today is not overdue` → `'2026-11-13'` → `overdue === false`; `'2026-11-14'` → `false`.
+- `today is computed in UTC` → store with `now: () => new Date('2026-11-13T23:30:00-05:00')`, `dueDate:'2026-11-13'` → `overdue === true`.
+- `done todos are never overdue, recomputed on read` → add past-dated, `update(1,{done:true}).overdue === false`, `update(1,{done:false}).overdue === true`.
+- `overdue recomputed as time passes` → mutable `let t = new Date('2026-11-13T12:00:00Z')`, `now: () => t`; add `dueDate:'2026-11-13'` → `get(1).overdue === false`; set `t = new Date('2026-11-14T00:00:00Z')` → `get(1).overdue === true`.
